                                                "sense_id": "408c88ad-c56a-3e91-9537-8f219719aed7",
                                                "text": "Customarily, if you borrow $10 for lunch from a coworker, writing IOU $10 on a yellow sticky note acts as a legal promissory note that you will repay said amount on payday."
                                            }
